## Driveline repairs and services

- Driveshaft repairs and replacements
- Universal joint replacements
- Center support bearing repairs
- Differential repairs
- Transfer case repairs
- CV joint repairs
- Alignment and balancing services

## Preventative maintenance for drivelines

Driveshaft inspections, lubrication of the universal joints and alignment checks
are cheap next to what they prevent. A worn U-joint is a vibration; the same
vibration six months later is a differential, a set of axle shafts and a truck
on a hook.

We wrote up how that progression actually works in [From U-joints to axle
shafts](/articles/from-u-joints-to-axle-shafts-how-driveline-problems-travel-down-to-your-axles).

